    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83c\udfaeNon-VR Mode!!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/211c7be19a5679095e347151cb0e98d5.avif?t=1747868687\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Ben</strong> has can be played with VR or without! Try  the new <strong>Non-VR</strong> demo to see if the game is for you!\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>slice-of-life adventure</strong> with a variety of <strong>activities</strong> and <strong>minigames</strong> to discover! Visit the charming seaside village of <strong>Kotobuki Town</strong>, <strong>befriend the locals</strong>, and <strong>work together to save a beloved local sushi bar</strong> from the machinations of dastardly landsharks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/f007acaa950fe7b6bdfaa1a051150e79.poster.avif?t=1747868687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/f007acaa950fe7b6bdfaa1a051150e79.webm?t=1747868687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Featuring <strong>immersive 3D manga panels</strong> and <strong>full Japanese voice acting</strong>, the colorful cast of characters are brought to life by the narrative talents of <strong>Moa</strong> \u2013 the creator of the critically acclaimed visual novel, <i>Hatoful Boyfriend</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/76e85c7f5913b761f2f4d03fdba52525.poster.avif?t=1747868687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/76e85c7f5913b761f2f4d03fdba52525.webm?t=1747868687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activities Abound:</strong> Fishing, archery, dog walking \u2013 and even ghost hunting...!?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Vibes:</strong> Kick back in a cozy Japanese town while jammin' to an original soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility &amp; Inclusivity:</strong> Customizable controls and multiple skin tone options!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comfortable Gameplay:</strong> SEATED, STANDING, and even <strong>NON-VR </strong>modes are available!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/6023eee5a0f4f283784a861fcebea784.avif?t=1747868687\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>slice-of-life adventure</strong> with a variety of <strong>activities</strong> and <strong>minigames</strong> to discover! Visit the charming seaside village of <strong>Kotobuki Town</strong>, <strong>befriend the locals</strong>, and <strong>work together to save a beloved local sushi bar</strong> from the machinations of dastardly landsharks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/f007acaa950fe7b6bdfaa1a051150e79.poster.avif?t=1747868687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/f007acaa950fe7b6bdfaa1a051150e79.webm?t=1747868687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Featuring <strong>immersive 3D manga panels</strong> and <strong>full Japanese voice acting</strong>, the colorful cast of characters are brought to life by the narrative talents of <strong>Moa</strong> \u2013 the creator of the critically acclaimed visual novel, <i>Hatoful Boyfriend</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/76e85c7f5913b761f2f4d03fdba52525.poster.avif?t=1747868687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/76e85c7f5913b761f2f4d03fdba52525.webm?t=1747868687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activities Abound:</strong> Fishing, archery, dog walking \u2013 and even ghost hunting...!?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Vibes:</strong> Kick back in a cozy Japanese town while jammin' to an original soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility &amp; Inclusivity:</strong> Customizable controls and multiple skin tone options!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comfortable Gameplay:</strong> SEATED, STANDING, and even <strong>NON-VR </strong>modes are available!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/6023eee5a0f4f283784a861fcebea784.avif?t=1747868687\" /></span></p>",
